# Backend

Read `docs/backend.md`. Use skill `firona-backend`.

- Apps: `catalog`, `sources`, `trends`. Do not dump new domain into `config/`.
- HTTP via nginx only (`/api`, `/admin`). Keep `USE_X_FORWARDED_*` settings.
- Collectors go in Celery, not in views.
- Call `assert_can_collect` before any collector HTTP. See `docs/sources.md`.
